# A turn that runs until rozu interrupts it.
< turn/start
> {"id":__ID__,"result":{"turn":{"id":"turn_1","items":[],"status":"inProgress"}}}
> {"method":"item/agentMessage/delta","params":{"delta":"Working on it","itemId":"msg_1","threadId":"thr_1","turnId":"turn_1"}}
< turn/interrupt
> {"id":__ID__,"result":{}}
> {"method":"turn/completed","params":{"threadId":"thr_1","turn":{"id":"turn_1","items":[],"status":"interrupted"}}}
